flowchart TD
    read["The reader turns a page, or leaves the reader"]
    local["Write locally first, always. Local is authoritative; sync is a projection"]

    identity{"Which identity does this publication get?"}
    server["1. The server's own identifier, when the source has one"]
    digest["2. Content digest: size, plus the first and last 64 KB"]
    path["3. A normalised path, the last resort"]

    store["ProgressStore: the three components are separate columns, filled in as they become known"]

    sync["A Kavita sync compares the remote position against the local one"]

    rule1["Remote ahead, local unchanged since last sync: adopt remote, silently"]
    rule2["Remote behind local: keep local, and push it"]
    rule3["Both changed since last sync: adopt the further position, tell the reader once"]
    rule4["One finished, one partial: finished wins"]

    gap1["NOT REACHABLE: syncedPosition is never written, so local always looks moved. Falls through to rule 3"]
    gap2["REACHED, PUSHES NOTHING: the toPush pile is discarded by both callers"]
    report["Positions reach the server by KavitaSync.report, on leaving the reader"]

    read --> local
    local --> identity
    identity -->|the source has one| server
    identity -->|a digest was computed| digest
    identity -->|every library scan lands here| path
    server --> store
    digest --> store
    path --> store
    store --> sync
    sync --> rule1
    sync --> rule2
    sync --> rule3
    sync --> rule4
    rule1 --> gap1
    gap1 --> rule3
    rule2 --> gap2
    gap2 --> report
